<Layouts.app
  flash={@flash}
  current_scope={@current_scope}
  locale={@locale}
  translated_path={if(@locale == "fr", do: ~p"/en/strategy", else: ~p"/fr/strategie")}
>
  <article id="strategy" class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-5 py-16 sm:py-24">
    <p class="eyebrow">{if(@locale == "fr", do: "Résumé", else: "Executive summary")}</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 font-heading text-5xl leading-tight text-stone-950 sm:text-6xl">
      {if(@locale == "fr", do: "Notre stratégie", else: "Our strategy")}
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-6 text-xl leading-9 text-stone-700">
      {if(@locale == "fr",
        do:
          "Des politiques solides ne suffisent pas si personne ne crée le soutien public nécessaire pour les faire adopter. PauseAI Canada veut aider des personnes informées à agir ensemble, avant qu'une crise ne force les gouvernements à improviser.",
        else:
          "Sound policy is not enough if nobody builds the public support needed to enact it. PauseAI Canada aims to help informed people act together before a crisis forces governments to improvise."
      )}
    </p>

    <div class="mt-12 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2">
      <section class="rounded-3xl border border-stone-200 bg-white p-7">
        <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl text-stone-950">
          {if(@locale == "fr", do: "Le problème", else: "The problem")}
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-stone-600">
          {if(@locale == "fr",
            do:
              "Même des responsables politiques convaincus hésitent à défendre une mesure coûteuse sans appui visible. Une fenêtre politique peut s'ouvrir soudainement, mais il est alors trop tard pour bâtir la confiance, les équipes et les réseaux nécessaires.",
            else:
              "Even persuaded policymakers hesitate to defend costly measures without visible support. A political window may open suddenly, but that is too late to build the trust, teams, and networks it requires."
          )}
        </p>
      </section>
      <section class="rounded-3xl border border-stone-200 bg-white p-7">
        <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl text-stone-950">
          {if(@locale == "fr", do: "Notre approche", else: "Our approach")}
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-stone-600">
          {if(@locale == "fr",
            do:
              "Informer sans imposer une conclusion, proposer une première action réalisable, puis aider les personnes qui le souhaitent à parler, participer, contribuer et organiser.",
            else:
              "Inform without prescribing a conclusion, offer one attainable first action, then help willing participants talk, show up, contribute, and organize."
          )}
        </p>
      </section>
      <section class="rounded-3xl border border-stone-200 bg-white p-7">
        <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl text-stone-950">
          {if(@locale == "fr", do: "Ce que nous mesurons", else: "What we measure")}
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-stone-600">
          {if(@locale == "fr",
            do:
              "Les gestes réels qui indiquent une progression: ressources consultées, conversations, participation, contacts politiques, bénévolat et organisation. Le journal personnel reste privé.",
            else:
              "Real actions that indicate progress: learning, conversations, participation, political contact, volunteering, and organizing. Each person's activity log remains private."
          )}
        </p>
      </section>
      <section class="rounded-3xl border border-stone-200 bg-white p-7">
        <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl text-stone-950">
          {if(@locale == "fr", do: "Ce que nous évitons", else: "What we avoid")}
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-stone-600">
          {if(@locale == "fr",
            do:
              "Pas de classement, de pression à maintenir une série ou de prétention qu'un parcours convient à tout le monde. La progression sert à proposer une prochaine étape, pas à noter les personnes.",
            else:
              "No leaderboards, streak pressure, or claim that one path fits everyone. Progress is used to offer a next step, not to score people."
          )}
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <section
      id="engagement-ladder"
      class="mt-12 rounded-[2rem] bg-stone-900 p-8 text-white sm:p-10"
    >
      <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl">
        {if(@locale == "fr",
          do: "Échelle d'engagement proposée",
          else: "Proposed engagement ladder"
        )}
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-white/70">
        {if(@locale == "fr",
          do: "À valider avec les organisatrices, organisateurs et membres.",
          else: "For validation with organizers and members."
        )}
      </p>
      <ol class="mt-7 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">
        <li
          :for={
            {en, fr, i} <- [
              {"Learn", "Comprendre", 1},
              {"Talk", "En parler", 2},
              {"Show up", "Participer", 3},
              {"Influence", "Intervenir", 4},
              {"Contribute", "Contribuer", 5},
              {"Organize", "Organiser", 6}
            ]
          }
          class="flex items-center gap-4 rounded-2xl bg-white/10 p-4"
        >
          <span class="flex size-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand font-bold text-stone-950">{i}</span>
          <span>{if(@locale == "fr", do: fr, else: en)}</span>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <p class="mt-10 text-sm leading-6 text-stone-500">
      {if(@locale == "fr",
        do:
          "Cette synthèse adapte au contexte canadien l'analyse de PauseAI sur la construction d'un mouvement social. Le texte intégral est en anglais (environ 42 min).",
        else:
          "This summary adapts PauseAI's movement-building analysis to the Canadian context. Read the full argument for its evidence and caveats (about 42 minutes)."
      )}
      <a
        class="ml-1 font-semibold text-stone-800 underline decoration-brand underline-offset-4"
        href="https://www.lesswrong.com/posts/aoqhszdEWqcFWbnda/existential-ai-safety-needs-an-effective-social-movement"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noreferrer"
      >{if(@locale == "fr",
        do: "Lire l'article original (en anglais) ↗",
        else: "Read the original article ↗"
      )}</a>
    </p>
  </article>
</Layouts.app>
